 <metadata>
  <name>AJ Bell Great North Run </name>
  <desc>This iconic half marathon sees 60,000 incredible people take their place on the start line in Newcastle upon Tyne, and travel 13.1 miles towards the beautiful coastline of South Shields.

If it's a Geordie welcome you're looking for then be prepared for the goosebumps as you hear the roar of thousands of supporters cheering your name, all the way from start to finish. </desc>
  <author>
   <name>Great Run</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/20495755"/>
  </author>
